 "inference": [
  "The IFV targeting jammer's lock multiplier is 0.6. Read as 40 percent resistance this is EA's new figure; the aircraft anti-radar passives hold 0.7, EA's old 30 percent, which EA did not change for aircraft.",
  "How a multiplier of 0.6 is applied (to lock progress per second, making locks take 1 / 0.6 = 1.67 times as long, or otherwise) is not stored in the row.",
  "The jammer's reactivation time is 10 s for both IFV and anti-air rows, EA's new deactivation time.",
  "The anti-air vehicle has no Antispotting LockOnTime row of its own.",
  "The Regeneration passive rows (MBT 9.5 s and 132, IFV 9.5 s and 110) remain in the registry although EA replaced that passive with Mine Sweeping, whose radius row holds 30.",
  "The other rows have no EA figure: durability 0.85 damage received for MBT and IFV, enhanced loading reload 1.35 (MBT), 1.5 and 1.25 (anti-air), medbay 5 initial then 20 per 0.9 s within 12.5 m, mobile trophy 3 charges with 10 s per charge."
 ],
